[{"id":162474203,"discussion_id":"f92707bf5796f735704bc354d1532506fde4bc84","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| conv | ✅ [*lileizheng*](https://gitcode.com/lileizheng), [*chenqi317*](https://gitcode.com/chenqi317) (2/2) | ✅ [*chenqi317*](https://gitcode.com/chenqi317), [*lileizheng*](https://gitcode.com/lileizheng) (2/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n","created_at":"2026-02-06T16:37:25+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-09T20:29:23+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162474226,"discussion_id":"401542438d1fe56354b9b8407160662b3938b583","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-02-06T16:37:33+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-06T16:37:33+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162474278,"discussion_id":"bbda460854d48dec962a9299bfd48a1885a6c591","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本PR旨在增强Conv3DBackpropFilterV2算子的兼容性，使其能够正确处理由DepthwiseConv2DBackpropFilter算子转换而来的场景。主要解决了在此转换场景下，Conv3DBackpropFilterV2算子的输出张量形状推导不正确的问题，确保其形状计算逻辑与Depthwise卷积的反向传播语义保持一致。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改方案的核心是在卷积反向传播形状推导的通用逻辑中，增加对特定运行时属性的检查和处理。具体而言，在`SetOutputShapeDim`函数中，新增了对`from_depthwise`布尔属性的判断。当该属性为真时，系统会根据输出张量的数据格式（`FORMAT_NCDHW`或`FORMAT_DHWCN`），对推导出的形状进行重塑，合并通道维度并将其重置为1。同时，在Conv3DBackpropFilterV2算子的注册信息中，新增了一个默认值为`false`的`from_depthwise`私有属性，作为此特殊处理逻辑的开关。","created_at":"2026-02-06T16:37:50+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-06T16:37:50+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":162474412,"discussion_id":"aaca41852e7fcd0890e8b7a8b253953676e2f044","body":"### 代码结构与可维护性: 第268行的注释“// 3: C dim, 4: N dim”存在错误。根据代码逻辑，当 `y_format` 为 `ge::FORMAT_DHWCN` 时，张量维度顺序为 (D, H, W, C, N)。第269行 `y_shape->SetDim(3, 1);` 是将索引3（即C维度）设置为1。第268行 `y_shape->SetDim(4, y_shape->GetDim(2) * y_shape->GetDim(3));` 中，`GetDim(2)` 获取的是W维度，`GetDim(3)` 获取的是C维度，两者相乘后赋值给索引4（即N维度）。因此，注释应更正为“// 2: W dim, 3: C dim, 4: N dim”。错误的注释会误导后续维护者。\n\n**问题类型**: 代码结构与可维护性\n**文件路径**: `conv/common/op_host/conv_backprop_infershape.cpp`\n**行号**: 267\n**问题代码**:\n```cpp\n        } else if (y_format == ge::FORMAT_DHWCN) {\n            y_shape->SetDim(4, y_shape->GetDim(2) * y_shape->GetDim(3)); // 3: C dim, 4: N dim\n            y_shape->SetDim(3, 1);\n```\n**修改建议**:\n```\n更正注释，准确描述所操作的维度索引及其含义。修改如下：\n```cpp\n        } else if (y_format == ge::FORMAT_DHWCN) {\n            y_shape->SetDim(4, y_shape->GetDim(2) * y_shape->GetDim(3)); // 2: W dim, 3: C dim, 4: N dim\n            y_shape->SetDim(3, 1);\n```\n```\n\n---\n*此评论由代码审查工具自动生成*","created_at":"2026-02-06T16:38:23+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-09T10:26:05+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"68d2070ae9c5fa79629530b4","login":"hongyiliu111","object_id":"68d2070ae9c5fa79629530b4","name":"hongyiliu111","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/hongyiliu111"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":267,"end_new_line":267,"start_old_line":267,"end_old_line":267,"position_type":"text"},"reply":[{"id":162684052,"body":"changed this line on [50fb2f99](https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-nn/commits/detail/50fb2f992fb86087a4d8709a90a40a630b23e237?ref=compatibility&prId=1640) view [diff detail](https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-nn/merge_requests/1640/diffs?diffId=5358752&start_sha=21187c56a3cbf88fc9ac4728e35418f57d632b6e&filePath=conv/common/op_host/conv_backprop_infershape.cpp#d534db9b92236a11c1d3d1a26491ba709632f8eb_267_267)","created_at":"2026-02-09T19:24:19+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-09T19:24:19+08:00","user":{"id":"68d2070ae9c5fa79629530b4","login":"hongyiliu111","object_id":"68d2070ae9c5fa79629530b4","name":"hongyiliu111","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/hongyiliu111"}}]},{"id":162616449,"discussion_id":"699f6101f00536e54e96727e5a26827289c493f3","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-02-09T11:42:26+08:00","updated_at":"2026-02-09T11:42:26+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":